  "ruleText": "Cub 207.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide a uniform procedure for the conduct of public forums and subcommittee meetings.\n\nSource. #8570-B, eff 2-18-06, EXPIRED: 2-18-14\n\nNew. #11163, INTERIM, eff 8-24-16, EXPIRED: 2-20-17\n\nNew. #12857-A, eff 8-23-19",
